\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {7.3}{\ignorespaces Surface-fit metrics for the two \textbf  {Route~A}{} variants. Median observed-to-surface residuals of $2.9$--$5.0$~mm confirm that the fused surfaces sit tightly on the registered returns; the P95 values show that a small tail of returns (often multipath or mis-segmented points) lies a few centimetres off. ``Supported'' is the fraction of surface within the stated radius of a measured return.}}{42}{table.caption.28}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:routeA_metrics}{{7.3}{42}{Surface-fit metrics for the two \routeA {} variants. Median observed-to-surface residuals of $2.9$--$5.0$~mm confirm that the fused surfaces sit tightly on the registered returns; the P95 values show that a small tail of returns (often multipath or mis-segmented points) lies a few centimetres off. ``Supported'' is the fraction of surface within the stated radius of a measured return}{table.caption.28}{}}
